PKG_ID=luna-systemui-recovery
PKG_VERSION=1.0.0
PKG_DESC="Restores stock luna-systemui (whole-directory replace) from a pristine device image - a rescue tool for undoing accumulated third-party patches. Installing this over our own surgical luna-systemui patch package is fine: each package keeps its own independent backup, and this one just resets the directory to stock (reinstall the patch package afterward if you still want it)."
